            <note corresp="#d31-f1" n="0" type="source" xml:id="d31-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, POL 32-1 ALG-MOR. Confidential.
                    Drafted by McClintic, cleared by Buffum and Jones, and approved by Tasca.
                    Repeated to Algiers, Paris, Madrid, Cairo, Tunis, and USUN.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d31-f2" n="1" xml:id="d31-f2-content">
                <p>Reported in telegram 1901 to Cairo, November 4. (Ibid.)</p>
